    <summary type="text">It&#39;s nice to see uv gaining popularity in so many places - and replacing vanilla pip with uv in containerized environmen</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;a href=&#34;https://nickjanetakis.com/blog/switching-pip-to-uv-in-a-dockerized-flask-or-django-app&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img&#xA;        src=&#34;https://shots.wayl.one/shot/?url=https://nickjanetakis.com/blog/switching-pip-to-uv-in-a-dockerized-flask-or-django-app&amp;height=450&amp;width=800&amp;scaled_width=800&amp;scaled_height=450&amp;selectors=&#34;&#xA;        alt=&#34;shot of post - Switching pip to uv in a Dockerized Flask / Django App — Nick Janetakis&#34;&#xA;        height=450&#xA;        width=800&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;rsquo;s my thought on &lt;a href=&#34;https://nickjanetakis.com/blog/switching-pip-to-uv-in-a-dockerized-flask-or-django-app&#34;&gt;Switching pip to uv in a Dockerized Flask / Django App — Nick Janetakis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;rsquo;s nice to see &lt;a href=&#34;/uv/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;uv by Astral.sh is one of the dopest python toolchain tools to ever exist&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;UV&#34;&gt;uv&lt;/a&gt; gaining popularity in so many places - and replacing vanilla pip with uv in containerized environments seems great due if for no other reason than the time you&amp;rsquo;ll save in CI&amp;hellip; A few years ago I refactored a disjointed container build process to use uv instead of pip, and due to the design of the build pipelines we went from 10-15 minute builds to 2-3 minutes&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;admonition note&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;admonition-title&#34;&gt;Note&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is one of [[ my-thoughts ]]. I picked this up from &lt;a href=&#34;https://waylonwalker.com&#34;&gt;Waylon Walker&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href=&#34;https://thoughts.waylonwalker.com&#34;&gt;https://thoughts.waylonwalker.com&lt;/a&gt;). It&amp;rsquo;s a short note that I make about someone else&amp;rsquo;s content online.  Learn more about the process &lt;a href=&#34;/thoughts/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Thoughts&#34; data-description=&#34;My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-06-09&#34; data-preview=&#34;My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed&#34;&gt;Thoughts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;</content>
